emotional cues have a new and remarkable clarity.", "short_description": "The Choice is an interactive VR experience inviting viewers to engage in a personal conversation with women who have had an abortion. The first interview introduces Kristen from Texas who shares her late-term abortion story. Through an interactive conversation, the viewer learns about her challenging decision to terminate a planned and wanted pregnancy.\n\nThis project is currently in development, and available here is a short teaser."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.infiniteframemedia.com/the-choice-vr-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Infinite Frame Media", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.thechoice-vr.com/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1008279844328894"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ART_CREATIVITY", "DOCUMENTARY_HISTORY", "NARRATIVE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "697619261645962"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "437912464606282"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "437912464606282"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1687604400, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "437912464606282"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "6324222590969594", "version": "1.3.4.4"}, "id": "452759492574753", "channel_name